// BT-3951 (ADR 0133): a Collection with only `do:`. The test file gives it a
// runtime class-side `withAll:` extension that the stdlib's `collect:` reaches
// through `self species withAll:`. Driven by adr0133enumerable_user_test.bt.

Collection subclass: Adr0133EnumerableExtWithAll
  field: items :: List = #()

  size -> Integer => self.items size

  do: block :: Block -> Nil =>
    self.items do: block
    nil

  printString -> String => "Adr0133EnumerableExtWithAll"
